          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p id="cf3-final-text" class="text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] text-ink font-serif leading-relaxed italic">
              (Complete your paragraph in Step 3 or revise in Step 4 to preview the final text here…)
            </p>
            <p id="cf3-final-ref" class="text-[13px] text-muted font-mono border-t border-navy/10 pt-3">
